{
  "id": "poem-526e13c235c4595619ad2ff9",
  "title": "生查子·含羞整翠鬟",
  "author": "欧阳修",
  "dynasty": "宋",
  "verses": [
    "含羞整翠鬟，得意频相顾。",
    "雁柱十三弦，一一春莺语。",
    "娇云容易飞，梦断知何处。",
    "深院锁黄昏，阵阵芭蕉雨。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "宋词选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/宋词/ci.song.0.json#record-625",
